cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "csl-guides — Cologne Digital Sanskrit Dictionaries: user, contributor, and developer guides"
message: >
  If you use these guides as documentation, cite this repository. If you use
  the dictionary data the guides describe, cite the CDSL corpus umbrella DOI
  10.5281/zenodo.21319331 (concept DOI of the csl-sqlite release corpus); an
  individual dictionary is cited by its own Zenodo concept DOI, listed at
  https://sanskrit-lexicon.github.io/cite.html.
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-guides
url: https://sanskrit-lexicon.github.io/csl-guides/
version: 0.16.1
date-released: 2026-11-09
abstract: >
  Documentation site for the Cologne Digital Sanskrit Dictionaries (CDSL):
  end-user guides, the 43-dictionary catalog with deep pages, tools
  (transliteration, quizzes, multi-dictionary comparison), the correction
  workflow, and the developer guide. Content: CC-BY-SA-4.0. The CDSL
  dictionary data itself is a separate, independently DOI'd artefact.
authors:
  - family-names: "Gasūns"
    given-names: "Mārcis"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4513-884X"
    affiliation: "Independent scholar"
    email: "gasyoun@ya.ru"
  - name: "Cologne Digital Sanskrit Lexicon project contributors"
keywords:
  - sanskrit
  - lexicography
  - cdsl
  - digital humanities
  - documentation
identifiers:
  - identifier: "10.5281/zenodo.21319331"
    type: "doi"
    description: "CDSL corpus umbrella DOI (csl-sqlite release corpus; cite this for the dictionary data, not for these guides)"
